WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:09.399
Vinnie and Mandy looked around.

2
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.170
They were in the shipyard.

3
00:00:12.171 --> 00:00:15.875
A group of men were building a Viking ship.

4
00:00:15.876 --> 00:00:19.740
It wasn't as big as the Sleeping Dragon.

5
00:00:19.741 --> 00:00:24.343
Still, the construction was amazing.

6
00:00:24.344 --> 00:00:28.954
Strong men dragged planks of oak wood.

7
00:00:28.955 --> 00:00:33.450
Others carefully carved the wood to shape the frame.

8
00:00:33.451 --> 00:00:38.697
"I remember reading in school about Viking ships," said Vinnie.

9
00:00:38.698 --> 00:00:42.612
"What did you learn?" asked Mandy.

10
00:00:42.613 --> 00:00:47.137
"Vikings were the best shipbuilders and seamen of their time.

11
00:00:47.138 --> 00:00:52.543
Their ships were so fast that nobody could catch them," said Vinnie.

12
00:00:52.544 --> 00:00:54.600
"I caught you!"

13
00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:57.643
Someone grabbed the children from behind.

14
00:00:57.644 --> 00:01:02.956
The children had not heard Gunnar sneaking up on them.

15
00:01:02.957 --> 00:01:06.819
"You scared us, Gunnar," cried Vinnie.

16
00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:10.619
"I thought you were my friends," he said.

17
00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.457
"Why did you steal from my master?"

18
00:01:13.458 --> 00:01:16.824
"We didn't," said Mandy.

19
00:01:16.825 --> 00:01:19.875
She explained what happened.

20
00:01:19.876 --> 00:01:22.959
"Oh!" said Gunnar.

21
00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:27.536
"The captain didn't mean to put his bear charm in that box."

22
00:01:27.537 --> 00:01:31.806
A silly mistake had caused all this trouble.

23
00:01:31.807 --> 00:01:35.675
"So, do you have the charm?" Gunnar asked.

24
00:01:35.676 --> 00:01:38.502
Mandy held it out to him.

25
00:01:38.503 --> 00:01:41.883
"We must return it," said Gunnar.

26
00:01:41.884 --> 00:01:46.870
Suddenly the sound of a horn rang loudly through the air.

27
00:01:46.871 --> 00:01:50.606
"The battle horn," Gunnar said excitedly.

28
00:01:50.607 --> 00:01:53.743
"What does that mean?" asked Vinnie.

29
00:01:53.744 --> 00:01:56.800
"It is calling the men to set sail."

30
00:01:56.801 --> 00:01:59.905
Gunnar ran toward the sound.

31
00:01:59.906 --> 00:02:02.280
Vinnie and Mandy followed.

32
00:02:02.281 --> 00:02:07.182
When they got to the harbor, the entire village was there.

33
00:02:07.183 --> 00:02:12.874
All the Viking warriors were hurrying to their ships.

34
00:02:12.875 --> 00:02:17.622
They wore leather helmets and carried wooden shields.

35
00:02:17.623 --> 00:02:21.675
The men swung their swords high in the air.

36
00:02:21.676 --> 00:02:24.875
The battle horn kept blaring.

37
00:02:24.876 --> 00:02:28.205
Old Dirk was watching the ships.

38
00:02:28.206 --> 00:02:31.472
"What's happening?" Gunnar asked.

39
00:02:31.473 --> 00:02:37.083
"New land needs to be conquered," Old Dirk explained.

40
00:02:37.084 --> 00:02:40.876
"All the ships will sail together to fight."

41
00:02:40.877 --> 00:02:45.762
The children searched for the Sleeping Dragon.

42
00:02:45.763 --> 00:02:52.554
"There it is!" Mandy shouted. "Vinnie, the photo!"

43
00:02:52.555 --> 00:02:55.206
Vinnie took the photo out.

44
00:02:55.207 --> 00:02:57.806
It was now glowing blue.

45
00:02:57.807 --> 00:03:02.339
"But what are these round plates?" Vinnie counted.

46
00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:05.491
"There are 16 in the picture."

47
00:03:05.492 --> 00:03:11.140
"Look! They're the Vikings' shields!" Mandy cried.

48
00:03:11.141 --> 00:03:17.020
On both sides of the Sleeping Dragon were round wooden shields.

49
00:03:17.021 --> 00:03:21.424
They marked the places where each Viking warrior sat.

50
00:03:21.425 --> 00:03:26.424
"But I count only 15," said Vinnie.

51
00:03:26.425 --> 00:03:29.539
"I must go," Gunnar said.

52
00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:32.536
"Do not worry about Skull-Crusher.

53
00:03:32.537 --> 00:03:34.885
I will give him the bear charm.

54
00:03:34.886 --> 00:03:36.738
Good-bye, my friends."

55
00:03:36.739 --> 00:03:41.367
He ran to the ship without looking back.

56
00:03:41.368 --> 00:03:45.874
"Gunnar is true to his name," Old Dirk said.

57
00:03:45.875 --> 00:03:49.872
"What does his name mean?" asked Mandy.

58
00:03:49.873 --> 00:03:51.942
"It means 'warrior.'"

59
00:03:51.943 --> 00:03:55.546
Vinnie and Mandy stared at the photo.

60
00:03:55.547 --> 00:03:59.164
The old man was next to a longship.

61
00:03:59.165 --> 00:04:03.758
They looked up at the Sleeping Dragon.

62
00:04:03.759 --> 00:04:08.337
Suddenly one more shield appeared on the ship.

63
00:04:08.338 --> 00:04:12.070
It was Gunnar's!

64
00:04:12.071 --> 00:04:15.071
Now they could see 16.

65
00:04:15.072 --> 00:04:18.267
The glow in the photo turned red.

66
00:04:18.268 --> 00:04:22.508
The children's eyes started to close.

67
00:04:22.509 --> 00:04:28.278
Then they were falling down the dark tunnel again.

68
00:04:28.279 --> 00:04:30.848
"Yow!"

69
00:04:30.849 --> 00:04:32.439
"Hey!"

70
00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:35.559
The children landed in the attic.

71
00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:44.925
It was still dark, but the sun was just about to rise.
